{"task_id": "Mbpp/3", "solution": "```python\ndef is_not_prime(n: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if an integer is non-prime.\n    Returns True for non-prime, False for prime.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 1:\n        return True\n    if n == 2:\n        return False\n    if n % 2 == 0:\n        return True\n    \n    # Check for odd divisors from 3 up to sqrt(n)\n    i = 3\n    while i * i <= n:\n        if n % i == 0:\n            return True\n        i += 2\n            \n    return False\n```"}
