{"task_id": "Mbpp/223", "solution": "def binarySearchFirst(array, n, element):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the first occurrence of an element in a sorted array segment.\n    Returns its index or -1 if not found.\n    \"\"\"\n    low = 0\n    high = n - 1\n    result = -1\n    while low <= high:\n        mid = low + (high - low) // 2\n        if array[mid] == element:\n            result = mid\n            high = mid - 1\n        elif array[mid] < element:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:  # array[mid] > element\n            high = mid - 1\n    return result\n\ndef binarySearchLast(array, n, element):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the last occurrence of an element in a sorted array segment.\n    Returns its index or -1 if not found.\n    \"\"\"\n    low = 0\n    high = n - 1\n    result = -1\n    while low <= high:\n        mid = low + (high - low) // 2\n        if array[mid] == element:\n            result = mid\n            low = mid + 1\n        elif array[mid] < element:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:  # array[mid] > element\n            high = mid - 1\n    return result\n\ndef is_majority(array, n, element):\n    \"\"\"\n    Determines if an element is the majority element in the first 'n' elements of a sorted array.\n    Majority is defined as strictly more than n/2 occurrences.\n    \"\"\"\n    effective_n = min(n, len(array))\n\n    if effective_n == 0:\n        return False\n\n    first_idx = binarySearchFirst(array, effective_n, element)\n\n    if first_idx == -1:\n        return False\n\n    last_idx = binarySearchLast(array, effective_n, element)\n\n    occurrence_count = last_idx - first_idx + 1\n\n    return occurrence_count > effective_n / 2"}
