{"task_id": "Mbpp/457", "solution": "def Find_Min(input_list):\n    \"\"\"Return a sublist from input_list that has the minimum length; on ties, return the first-occurring minimal sublist.\"\"\"\n    min_sublist = input_list[0]\n    min_length = len(input_list[0])\n\n    for i in range(1, len(input_list)):\n        current_sublist = input_list[i]\n        current_length = len(current_sublist)\n\n        if current_length < min_length:\n            min_length = current_length\n            min_sublist = current_sublist\n    \n    return min_sublist"}
