{"task_id": "Mbpp/459", "solution": "```python\ndef _is_ascii_uppercase(char: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if a character is an ASCII uppercase letter (A-Z) using ordinals.\"\"\"\n    return ord('A') <= ord(char) <= ord('Z')\n\ndef remove_uppercase(input: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Removes all ASCII uppercase characters (A-Z) from the input string.\"\"\"\n    result_chars = []\n    for char in input:\n        if not _is_ascii_uppercase(char):\n            result_chars.append(char)\n    return \"\".join(result_chars)\n```"}
